WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
How it works. The title and what this film covers.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Two names. Pravrudhi-Nyaya is the product; Prabhasa-Nyaya is our own trained models; the system is a second reader that refers when it cannot support a statement.

3
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:51.000
The corpus. Real judgments and orders are gathered, cleaned, read by two model readers, checked and split into training, held-out testing and evaluation sets.

4
00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Element judges. Element judges: our trained models that read one ingredient at a time. An offence is broken into ingredients; a 4B judge scores each, a 32B judge checks the same ones, and the AND rule needs both.

5
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:49.000
The harness. Deterministic assembly, the quote check, the Lean structure check and refer-first decide; no model decides.

6
00:01:49.000 --> 00:02:19.000
Nyaya grounding. Pramana, nirnaya withheld and agama, explained in plain words.

7
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:45.000
The assistant. The optional Claude managed-agent assistant: consent, spending limits, and the core still decides. Offered to signed-in users; optional, with a consent box each run.

8
00:02:45.000 --> 00:03:09.000
Citations. An existence-only check against an index of judgments, and the rule that keeps a name match from passing as proof.

9
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:35.000
Serving and cost. Local machines plus serverless GPUs, a fallback endpoint, and what idle costs.

10
00:03:35.000 --> 00:04:03.000
Evaluation discipline. Evaluation items are checked against training data, every look at the evaluation set is counted, and results that show no effect are reported.

11
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:11.000
End card. Name, line and where the technical report lives.
